# The reminder's Complete action while Home is open (NotificationManager
# completeReminder, the code a Complete tap runs after reading its payload).
# The simulator can't tap a notification action, so pillie://debug/notification-complete
# calls it for today. Home must redraw: the status card turns to taken, the CTA
# becomes undo, and the pack card pops today's tile.
fresh
launch
wait text "Get started" 15
openurl "pillie://debug/plus-home?lang=en"
openurl pillie://debug/trial-grant?lang=en
# DebugQA.trialEveOfBreak: today is pill 21, due and untaken.
openurl pillie://debug/trial-eve-of-break?lang=en
wait text "Last hormone pill · sugar pills next" 10
wait text "Take pill" 10
shot due
openurl pillie://debug/notification-complete?lang=en
wait text "That's logged. Tap to undo." 10
wait text "Taken today" 10
gone text "Take pill" 5
shot completed
